behaviour.graze.name=a quiet graze
behaviour.graze.note=Grazes slowly, head down, for as long as the grass lasts.
behaviour.tail_swish.name=a tail swish
behaviour.tail_swish.note=Swishes its tail lazily when it is content.
behaviour.dust_bathe.name=a dust bath
behaviour.dust_bathe.note=Fluffs up and rolls in dry dirt to keep its feathers clean.
behaviour.peck.name=a busy peck
behaviour.peck.note=Pecks at the ground, sure there is something tasty there.
behaviour.flap.name=a happy flap
behaviour.flap.note=Flaps its wings when it is pleased or startled.
behaviour.mud_roll.name=a mud roll
behaviour.mud_roll.note=Rolls in mud to cool off, and looks very pleased about it.
behaviour.snuffle.name=a snuffle
behaviour.snuffle.note=Snuffles along the ground, nose first, hunting for treasure.
behaviour.pronk.name=a joyful pronk
behaviour.pronk.note=Springs straight up on all four legs when it is happy.
behaviour.lily_hop.name=a lily pad hop
behaviour.lily_hop.note=Hops from lily pad to lily pad without getting its feet wet.
behaviour.croak.name=an evening croak
behaviour.croak.note=Croaks to its neighbours, loudest around dusk.
behaviour.follow_parent.name=following a parent
behaviour.follow_parent.note=Little ones trail after a parent wherever it goes.
behaviour.socialise.name=a friendly chat
behaviour.socialise.note=Seeks out its housemates for a friendly nuzzle.
behaviour.nap.name=a little nap
behaviour.nap.note=Settles down for a nap somewhere warm and safe.
behaviour.toy_ball.name=playing with a ball
behaviour.toy_ball.note=Nudges a ball about the yard, very seriously.
behaviour.toy_post.name=a good scratch
behaviour.toy_post.note=Rubs against a scratching post until every itch is gone.
behaviour.toy_bell.name=ringing a bell
behaviour.toy_bell.note=Rings a hanging bell, then looks around to see who heard.
behaviour.toy_duck.name=playing with a floating duck
behaviour.toy_duck.note=Paddles after a floating toy duck.
behaviour.toy_log.name=playing with a log
behaviour.toy_log.note=Climbs on, under and around a hollow log.

