guide.title=How to ranch
guide.subtitle=Everything you need to get started.
guide.friend.title=Make a friend
guide.friend.1=Hold a food the animal likes.
guide.friend.2=Crouch and walk up slowly. Running scares it away.
guide.friend.3=Feed it a few times until it trusts you.
guide.friend.4=Then give your new friend a name.
guide.home.title=Build a home
guide.home.1=Each animal needs its own kind of house. Craft one at a Farmer's Workbench.
guide.home.2=Place the house. Use it while your friends follow you to move them in.
guide.home.3=Open the house and press Show area to see its yard.
guide.happy.title=Keep them happy
guide.happy.1=Put a trough in the yard and fill it with food.
guide.happy.2=Add the decorations they like. The house page shows what is missing.
guide.happy.3=Pet each friend once a day.
guide.babies.title=Babies
guide.babies.1=Two happy friends of the same kind who share a home may have a baby.
guide.babies.2=Look for new babies in the morning.
guide.produce.title=Produce
guide.produce.1=Happy animals make eggs, milk, wool and more.
guide.produce.2=Open their house and press Collect. Bring an empty bucket for each milk.
guide.frogs.title=Frogs
guide.frogs.1=Frogs only eat crickets. Craft a Jar of Crickets for them.
guide.frogs.2=Frogs are shy. Offer the crickets from a few steps away.

